Hello all,

	I'm glad that I can announce official ALSA binding for the 
python. Actually, the binding covers only simple mixer layer, but I'll 
create a binding for the bottom universal control interface as well.
	If someone does like to join my attempt or test the binding, 
please, let me know.
	The binding is available here: 
http://hg.alsa-project.org/alsa-python/ . Note it's alpha type code, of 
course.

						Jaroslav

